. do co2_exclusion_suite_cl.do 

. * COUNTRY-CLUSTERED COPY generated by _make_cl_dofiles.py on 2026-09-03 from 
> co2_exclusion_suite.do (vce -> cluster(isocode); outputs *_cl.csv)
. *============================================================================
> ==
. * co2_exclusion_suite.do   (LZ comment 4, 2026-09-03)
. * Exclusion-restriction diagnostics for the Feyrer instrument.
. *   A  non-aviation placebo outcomes (RF and 2SLS)
. *   B  horse race: aviation-technology x geography vs world GDP / oil / trade
>  x geography
. *   C  placebo instrument: a_t x ln sea market access 1996
. *   D  zero-first-stage test: top baseline-connectivity tercile
. *   E  development-channel controls, coefficient path
. *   F  alternative technology series and distance-decay exponents
. *   G  leads of the instrument
. *   H  overidentification with the tourism instrument (Hansen J)
. *   I  standard-error variants (cluster country, two-way, Conley HAC if acreg
>  available)
. * Inputs: gaci_panel_combined.csv, co2_country_year.csv, placebo_covariates.c
> sv
. * Export: _exclusion_suite.csv (panel item stat b se p f nn)
. *============================================================================
> ==
